From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] po/de: German translation of the new strings
Description:
 German translation of the strings added by the other patches of this
 series: the contact view, the buttons of the contacts page and of the
 call history, and the SIM choice of the dialer (call buttons, menu,
 settings).
Forwarded: not-needed
License: as the patched files (the translations are under the license of the translated program)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
---
--- a/po/de/plasma-dialer.po
+++ b/po/de/plasma-dialer.po
@@ -335,6 +335,122 @@ msgstr "Senden"
 msgid "Cancel USSD session"
 msgstr "USSD-Sitzung abbrechen"
 
+msgid "Name"
+msgstr "Name"
+
+msgid "Add phone number"
+msgstr "Telefonnummer hinzufügen"
+
+msgid "Add profile picture"
+msgstr "Profilbild hinzufügen"
+
+#, kde-format
+msgctxt "@action:button %1 is a phone number"
+msgid "Put %1 into the dial pad"
+msgstr "%1 in die Wähltasten übernehmen"
+
+msgctxt "@action:button"
+msgid "Add photo"
+msgstr "Foto hinzufügen"
+
+msgctxt "@action:button"
+msgid "Change photo"
+msgstr "Foto ändern"
+
+msgctxt "@action:button"
+msgid "Remove photo"
+msgstr "Foto entfernen"
+
+msgctxt "@action:button"
+msgid "Remove number"
